    # Native records need their actual boundary
    ROLE: ARCHITECT — Nyx Copperwing. Same writing worktree /Users/feral/mydev/bboxy450-term-mcp-recovery-spec-20261029 and existing branch. Oracle has accepted381's corrected contract,394's allocation and455's source-backed readiness map as design deliverables only. Their code/promise gates remain separate. Rook465 now implements operation_get against your corrected9aec contract; Lumen73/49 full verification continues independently.

    Use accepted317's eight-row map to close the precise records design gaps before Executor work for GitHub1–4. Read current source and verified remote main6641b5b7 (issue63 compatibility is now landed/full0); don't count unlanded cohorts as current product. Amend only the existing numbered contracts listed above, preserving identities and existing promises. No new framework/process document, separate graph store, broad protocol rewrite or duplicate implementation plan.

    Specify the smallest integrated native path for N1's visible externally broken private record, N2's numbered decision and five directed typed links, N4's actual seat/work/provenance/subscription Graph panels, and especially N3's proposal→digest-pinned comment→decision→spec RFC. Current GraphTab mounts E2E only; operator RecordWrite restricts generic types and knowledge fetch checks current digest. These are product gaps, not test omissions. Reuse existing graph/components/root-scoped projections, native input/frame hooks and host writer. State what crosses each existing boundary, current scope/grants, stale/root/restart behavior and how absent/invalid/unavailable data appear honestly.

    Resolve old reviewed digest A versus revised B explicitly: where exact immutable reviewed bytes come from, retention/size budget, safe historical addressing/read authority, signer device versus seat, etag/admission/dedup semantics, and which builtin/provider capabilities are actually supported. Never silently display B under A, infer a version from filename/Git guesses, grant caller-selected signer/path or falsely broaden external host-signed writes58. Preserve exact-document/Graph fences and selected Recent chat contract. Any unavoidable protocol addition must be minimal and owned in the current ICD, not invented in a DM; name both owners and review state. No archival hack, new global worker, approval queue or operator test prerequisite.

    Map every promise to credible native/source-bound frame and provider assertions, including causal controls, broken row distinct from rejected write, correct five edge IDs/directions, live panels and historical comment/version separation after restart. Reuse existing Make/native fixture workflows and unchanged thresholds. Exact proposed implementation paths belong in317, limited to what this agreement actually authorizes; no code here. Deliver a concise signed draft promptly for consumer review before broad work. make test-licenses plus original frontmatter/link integrity checks are the focused design gate. Full-source gate limitation remains explicit under the existing capacity exception; do not cold-rebuild unchanged law at current insufficient capacity. No code/tests/scripts, task lifecycle edits, live runtime/credentials, peer targets/cache cleanup, new recruitment, merge/push or issue closure. Report signed source, actual exits/log hashes, source-line mechanisms and remaining unimplemented promises.

